    "title": "4 football players from Mobile County, Alabama high schools committed to college football in August 2026",
    "text": "4 football players from Mobile County, Alabama high schools committed to college football in August 2026\nA. C. Sims\nFour football players from high schools in Mobile County, Alabama are listed by Prep Redzone as having committed to play college football during August 2026.\nVigor High School led with three commitments, while Theodore High School accounted for the fourth.\nThe players committed to four different colleges, with each college receiving one commitment.\nAmong the players from Mobile County high schools, Jabarrius Garror from Vigor High School committed to The University of Texas at Austin on August 16, 2026, Miguel Wilson from Vigor High School committed to Kentucky on August 18, 2026, Zy Wilson from Vigor High School committed to Arkansas State University on August 24, 2026, and Julian Mcdonald from Theodore High School committed to Mississippi State on August 18, 2026.\n| Player | High school | College | Commitment date | Position |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|\nJulian McdonaldMiguel WilsonZy WilsonAll commitment information in this article is reported by Prep Redzone.",
    "summary": "4 football players from Mobile County, Alabama high schools committed to college football in August 2026 Four football players from high schools in Mobile County, Alabama are listed by Prep Redzone as having committed to play college football during August 2026. Vigor High School led with three commitments, while Theodore High School accounted for the fourth. The players committed to four different colleges, with each college receiving one commitment.",
